# Smart Waste Management System using IoT

## Overview
This project is an IoT-based Smart Waste Management System developed to monitor garbage bin levels using sensors. The system helps improve waste collection efficiency and supports a cleaner environment.

## Features
- Real-time garbage level monitoring
- Smart waste collection
- Low-cost and easy to use
- Environment-friendly solution

## Technologies Used
- Arduino UNO
- Ultrasonic Sensor
- Embedded C
- IoT

## Future Improvements
- Mobile App Integration
- GPS Tracking
- Cloud Data Storage

